# Personal notes — the Obsidian vault at the repo root. Anchored: an
# unanchored `dev/` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which
# silently swallowed frontend/src/dev/ — and Tailwind skips gitignored files
# when it scans for class names, so that directory's styles went missing from
# the build with nothing reporting an error.
/dev/

